msgstr "Breach notice to the controller"

#. module: bf_federation_privacy
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_federation_privacy/models/privacy_breach_notice.py:0
msgid "Avis de violation reçu de %s : évaluer le risque"
msgstr "Breach notice received from %s: assess the risk"

#. module: bf_federation_privacy
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_federation_privacy.view_breach_notice_form_federation
msgid "Avis reçu de"
msgstr "Notice received from"

#. module: bf_federation_privacy
#: model:ir.model,name:bf_federation_privacy.model_federation_outbox
msgid "Boîte de sortie de la fédération"
msgstr "Federation outbox"

#. module: bf_federation_privacy
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_federation_privacy.field_privacy_breach_notice__ack_channel
msgid "Canal de l'accusé"
msgstr "Acknowledgement channel"

#. module: bf_federation_privacy
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_federation_privacy/models/privacy_breach_notice.py:0
msgid "Cet avis n'est pas arrivé par la fédération."
msgstr "This notice did not arrive through federation."

#. module: bf_federation_privacy
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_federation_privacy.field_privacy_breach_notice__federation_remote_url
msgid "Chez le pair"
msgstr "At the peer"

#. module: bf_federation_privacy
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_federation_privacy/models/privacy_breach_notice.py:0
msgid "Chiffrement : %s"
msgstr "Encryption: %s"

#. module: bf_federation_privacy
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_federation_privacy/models/privacy_breach_notice.py:0
msgid "Corps policier en cause : %s"
msgstr "Police involved: %s"

#. module: bf_federation_privacy
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_federation_privacy.field_privacy_breach_notice__incident_id
msgid "Fiche du registre"
msgstr "Register record"

#. module: bf_federation_privacy
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:bf_federation_privacy.selection__privacy_breach_notice__ack_channel__federation
msgid "Fédération"
msgstr "Federation"

#. module: bf_federation_privacy
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_federation_privacy.field_privacy_breach_notice__federation_possible
msgid "Fédération possible"
msgstr "Federation possible"

#. module: bf_federation_privacy
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_federation_privacy/models/privacy_breach_notice.py:0
msgid ""
"Fédérer un avis de violation demande le rôle de gestionnaire de la vie "
"privée."
msgstr "Federating a breach notice requires the privacy manager role."

#. module: bf_federation_privacy
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_federation_privacy.field_privacy_breach_notice__federation_peer_id
msgid "Fédéré avec"
msgstr "Federated with"

#. module: bf_federation_privacy
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_federation_privacy.field_federation_outbox__kind
msgid "Genre"
msgstr "Kind"

#. module: bf_federation_privacy
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_federation_privacy.view_breach_notice_form_federation
msgid ""
"L'accusé atteste que l'avis vous est parvenu, pour le texte dont l'empreinte"
" figure ici. Il ne dit pas que vous êtes d'accord avec son contenu."
msgstr ""
"The acknowledgement attests that the notice reached you, for the text whose "
"fingerprint appears here. It does not say that you agree with its content."

#. module: bf_federation_privacy
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_federation_privacy/models/privacy_breach_notice.py:0
msgid ""
"L'accusé se donne par le responsable de la protection des renseignements "
"personnels désigné, ou par un membre du groupe qui exerce cette fonction."
msgstr ""
"The acknowledgement is given by the designated person in charge of the "
"protection of personal information, or by a member of the group that holds "
"this function."

#. module: bf_federation_privacy
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_federation_privacy/models/privacy_breach_notice.py:0
msgid "L'empreinte annoncée ne correspond pas au PDF reçu."
msgstr "The announced fingerprint does not match the PDF received."

#. module: bf_federation_privacy
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_federation_privacy/models/privacy_breach_notice.py:0
msgid ""
"Le PDF de cet avis n'a pas traversé la fédération : accusez réception par le"
" lien du courriel du mandataire, qui le porte. Un accusé ne peut pas porter "
"sur un texte que vous n'avez pas reçu."
msgstr ""
"The PDF of this notice did not cross the federation: acknowledge receipt "
"through the link in the service provider's email, which carries it. An "
"acknowledgement cannot cover a text you did not receive."

#. module: bf_federation_privacy
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_federation_privacy/models/privacy_breach_notice.py:0
msgid ""
"Le PDF n'a pas traversé la fédération (plafond de pièces jointes de %s) : le"
" client a les faits dans son registre, et accusera réception par le lien du "
"courriel, qui porte le PDF."
msgstr ""
"The PDF did not cross the federation (attachment limit of %s): the client "
"has the facts in its register, and will acknowledge receipt through the "
"email link, which carries the PDF."

#. module: bf_federation_privacy
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_federation_privacy.field_privacy_breach_notice__processor_name
msgid "Le nom du mandataire tel qu'il l'a envoyé."
msgstr "The service provider's name as it sent it."

#. module: bf_federation_privacy
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_federation_privacy.field_privacy_breach_notice__federation_peer_id
msgid ""
"Le pair chez qui cet objet a un miroir. Vider le champ archive le miroir."
msgstr ""
"The peer where this object has a mirror. Clearing the field archives the "
"mirror."

#. module: bf_federation_privacy
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_federation_privacy.field_privacy_breach_notice__federation_shared_peer_id
msgid ""
"Le pair à qui l'avis signé a été partagé. Seul son accusé compte, même si le"
" lien est détaché plus tard."
msgstr ""
"The peer the signed notice was shared with. Only its acknowledgement counts,"
" even if the link is detached later."

#. module: bf_federation_privacy
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_federation_privacy/models/federation_link.py:0
msgid ""
"Les liens d'un avis de violation se posent seuls, au partage ou à la "
"réception."
msgstr ""
"Breach notice links are set by the system alone, when the notice is shared "
"or received."

#. module: bf_federation_privacy
#: model:ir.model,name:bf_federation_privacy.model_federation_link
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_federation_privacy.field_privacy_breach_notice__federation_link_id
msgid "Lien fédéré"
msgstr "Federated link"

#. module: bf_federation_privacy
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_federation_privacy.field_privacy_breach_notice__processor_name
msgid "Mandataire"
msgstr "Service provider"

#. module: bf_federation_privacy
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_federation_privacy/models/privacy_breach_notice.py:0
